WEBVTT

00:06:58.658 --> 00:07:02.842
that there's a special place in hell
for women who don't support women.

00:07:03.346 --> 00:07:04.497
In this world,

00:07:04.521 --> 00:07:06.354
we need to be there for each other.

00:07:07.409 --> 00:07:10.423
JG: There's a bit of good news
and bad news here.

00:07:10.447 --> 00:07:12.032
Certainly the research shows

00:07:12.056 --> 00:07:14.959
that the stereotype
about the businesswoman

00:07:14.983 --> 00:07:16.517
who makes it to the top

00:07:16.541 --> 00:07:19.136
and then stops other women coming through

00:07:19.160 --> 00:07:21.215
isn't borne out by the facts.

00:07:21.239 --> 00:07:22.763
The constraint seems to be

00:07:22.787 --> 00:07:26.492
that organizations think
once they've got a woman or two,

00:07:26.516 --> 00:07:29.000
they don't need to worry
about gender anymore.

00:07:29.364 --> 00:07:31.301
But we do have to be frank --